    <note type="project" target="#dat1">Whitman probably created this manuscript sometime in May 1888, since Horace Traubel records that Whitman gave him the essay copy to deliver to the printer on 28 May 1888. (See <hi rend="italic">With Walt Whitman in Camden</hi> [Boston: Small, Maynard &amp; Company, 1906] 1:238).
    
    </note>
     <note type="work_relations" target="xxx.00410" cert="high">
      <p>This draft of a footnote to the essay "A Backward Glance O'er Travel'd Roads" was first printed in the 1888 volume <hi rend="italic">November Boughs</hi>, although the essay itself grew out of several previously published pieces.</p>
